WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.080
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:39.220
How disrespectful of you to make me wait, Zao.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:47.350
You've reached the time limit, Master Lee-Leng.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.200
Relying on the Course of Love

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.020
You are still angry.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.980
If you knew that why would you do something like this?

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.100
It's something that you won't understand.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:11.170
Marriage with Master Kajika would be a joyous event for you and the Huang Group.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.380
But, you decided to step down as the leader!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.460
I cannot understand that!

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:21.160
It's something that I've thought through many times.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:25.060
She is free spirited like a bird.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:29.360
She would not be fit as the wife of the Huang leader.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:35.440
Additionally, Raginei is at peace now, but she'll get sucked in to other problems.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.780
I want to be able to protect her.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.110
In order to do that, I can't be the leader of the Huangs.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.150
It's impossible to do both.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:49.350
You're saying that you're going to pick Master Kajika over the Huangs?!

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:57.920
Master Lee-Leng! 
 I thought there was no hope for the Huangs.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.900
A hereditary system common in well known families. Power struggle among the elders...

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.880
...The Huangs were like the dinosaur on the verge of being extinct.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.980
In the midst of that, I was invited to meet the new leader.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:18.490
That leader was only a thirteen year old boy, but...

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.590
...I saw him as more mature than the adults.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.790
That's when I thought to myself, that I'll go all in for him!

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:36.010
After that, playing to the elders' cards...

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:40.080
...you marvelously straightened out the Huang Group that was warped.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:45.180
Zao--- I still love my family.

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:49.870
- Master Lee-Leng. 
 - Please understand.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.540
Kajika means more than that to me!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.490
I'm not able to be there for both! 
This was the only option left to me!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:04.050
- Nothing I say can change your mind? 
 - This is the conclusion I came to.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.970
There's someone that I brought to this country.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:20.520
I'm sure he has his aim locked on Master Kajika.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.320
Unless I tell him to abort the mission, he'll probably pull the trigger.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:32.950
- Zao! 
- I'm serious Master Lee-Leng.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:40.070
If that is true, Harry won't let you or the Huangs live!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:44.390
If that is the case, you are to fight Director Harry as the leader of the Huangs!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:48.350
- You will be able to do it! 
- You're out of your mind!

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:51.260
I will not return to the Huangs that will kill Kajika!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:54.320
No, you will definitely return!

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.750
You won't be able to leave the Huangs that will be eaten up by Burnsworth!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.620
I know that you have a weak spot inside of you.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:09.380
But, you have a strength that can overcome that weakness.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:15.240
Amid contradictions like that you are to bear that!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.340
That's what it means to be the the leader!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.600
You should have been the leader, Zao.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:34.300
I'm able to work to my full potential when there is a "head" that I can serve.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.860
You are an irreplaceable "head" of the group.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.060
Call it off.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.400
- If you are willing to concede to my demands. 
- Demands?!

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:57.150
Go home to Singapore and marry Master Ling-Lee.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.840
Are you telling me to part with Kajika?!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:13.040
<i>I know how clever Zao can be in these situations!</i>

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.040
<i>My plan was supposed to protect Kajika.</i>

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:21.530
<i>But, it's brought about the exact opposite outcome!</i>

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.470
Please decide.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:35.040
I will return to the Huangs and I will marry Ling-Lee.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.350
Master Lee-Leng.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:44.860
I will not see Kajika anymore.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.710
Never again.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.850
Master Kajika.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:07.000
Master Kajika. Is it about Master Lee-Leng?

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:12.360
He went back to Singapore without telling me.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:15.930
Maybe it was something urgent with the company.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.300
- Right. 
- You should contact him when you get back.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.500
<i>What is this anxiety that I have?!</i>

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.890
<i>This happens often where I can't see Lee-Leng because of his work, but---</i>

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.710
- I'm home. 
- Kajika.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.840
- Welcome home! 
- Maria!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.710
- What are you doing here?! 
- Master has called me here.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:56.860
Oh you've grown up so much! 
 You have a boyfriend now!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.700
- Is it Lee-Leng?! 
 - How did you know?

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:07.050
I raised you, I'm like your mother. 
 Of course I know everything about my daughter!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:12.940
I'm so glad! I was wondering when you were going to realize this.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:17.720
- Realize what? 
- He always...

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.480
...was in love with you!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.260
He always seemed so lonely.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.020
But every time he was with you...

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.340
...he seemed to be happy from the bottom of his heart.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.810
This is what I thought...

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:45.960
...that you were the only one that could save him.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:51.480
- I'm really glad! 
- Maria!  - Master Kajika.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:55.240
I'm sorry to interrupt you.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.350
- What is it? 
- You have a guest.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.450
Carl!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.120
- Kajika. 
- All these guests! I'm so happy!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.410
I'm glad you're alright.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.610
I'm sorry to get you involved. 
 I can't apologize enough.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.870
Don't worry about it Carl.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.990
I said I wanted to protect you but I was no help.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.470
I was in over my head.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.600
It's not your fault Carl.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:34.610
With that incident, I was able to know my true feelings.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.150
He--- Lee-Leng is a great guy.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:45.030
He called me.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:49.790
He told me that you were alright.
 He was thinking about me too.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.920
- Lee-Leng called you? 
- It was strange.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.470
I couldn't get myself to hate him.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:59.820
- A man that'll steal you away from me. 
- Carl.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.630
I came here because I was able to muster up some courage.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:10.210
- My dad regained his consciousness. 
- Really?

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:13.490
Right away, after he was admitted to a hospital in the States.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:21.410
Until then, I didn't have any feelings seeing my father lying in his bed.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:32.000
I saw his thin hands move across the sheets calling my name and looking for me.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.650
Then I started crying.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:44.430
The tears that I shed before were because I felt sorry for myself.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:49.740
But, now I was able to cry because I was happy.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:56.590
I thought that we might finally be able to reconcile.

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:02.890
It's so interesting, that people don't know what they are truly feeling sometimes.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.600
But, there were somethings that could not be changed.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:14.280
You told me before--- 
to take other women in to consideration.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.380
But, that's impossible for me to do.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.170
You are the only woman that I love.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:28.000
I won't have these kinds of feelings for other women, ever.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.520
- Carl. 
- I can't help it. That's what I'm feeling.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:38.540
You are my muse, even if you don't love me.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.040
I'm sorry, Carl.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.360
I'm sorry.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:49.170
Don't apologize. 
 I don't want to see you get sad.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.570
I'm content as long as you are smiling.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:57.230
<i>It's true. I really do think that.</i>

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:01.000
<i>But, half of it's a lie.</i>

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.900
My work will let me forget her.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:15.350
<i>On the 13th, the director of the Huang Group, Lee-Leng Huang, announced his engagement.</i>

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:20.280
<i>His fiancé is Ling-Lee Huang, the daughter of Jin Huang from the Huang Group.</i>

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:27.030
<i>Citing health problems of Mr. Jin, the ceremony will take place next week...</i>

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.850
<i>...in Singapore.</i>

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:34.910
<i>What is this about?! 
 Kajika didn't know any of this!</i>

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:39.220
<i>On top of that, it's only one week until they get married?!</i>

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.740
- Get an appointment with Lee-Leng! 
- Yes, sir!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:49.670
This has to be a mistake! 
Why would Master Lee-Leng marry anyone else?!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.860
What did you just say?

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.780
Lee-Leng is getting married?

00:12:58.390 --> 00:12:59.770
Master Kajika.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:03.320
It's a lie! 
 He promised...

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.030
...that we'd go to Givoli Island together!

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:15.650
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:20.430
It's a lie that Lee-Leng is getting married, right?!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.520
No.
 There is no mistake.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:29.500
The wedding is going to be held only with the family.
 Unfortunately you can't come.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:35.400
- Let me speak to Lee-Leng! 
- Master Lee-Leng is very busy at the moment.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:41.860
I will have him call you once things settle down. 
 Now, excuse me.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.500
Zao! Zao! Zao!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.950
<i>What happened?! 
 I don't understand.</i>

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.470
- Master Kajika! 
- Don't come near me!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.790
<i>Let's go to Givoli Island.</i>

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.470
Really?! 
 You'll come with me Lee-Leng?!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.940
How long has it been since you've taken a vacation?

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:23.400
I don't recall. 
 It's probably my first vacation ever.

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.590
You're the hardest working man on earth!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.140
- Let's take a break until you get bored! 
- Until I get bored?!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:36.400
Whether it's one or two years, until you say "I've had enough!"

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:41.020
- Right. 
- Let's spend time relaxing until then.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:46.780
We'll go fishing, picking fruits and we'll spend the day lying on the beach!

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.520
Just like it was in the past, again!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:01.090
I don't understand, Lee-Leng.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:07.170
What am I supposed to do?!
 I'm lost.

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.300
Kajika. 
 Don't cry.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:18.030
Look up at me.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.670
Dad?

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:49.410
Master Lee-Leng, I brought your food.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:54.250
- Take it away. 
- You can't.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.720
You haven't eaten anything in the past few days.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.260
We can't have you pass out at the ceremony.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.650
My body won't accept it.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.760
Master Lee-Leng, I don't mind if you blame me.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:14.250
But, you'll thank me one day for this.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:19.160
A broken heart is just like a fever that will fade away.

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:25.630
So, you're saying that this poison inside of me will fade away one day?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:27.700
Yes. It will.

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:31.870
Ling-Lee came here a few moments ago.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:38.880
What is being a burden upon you? 
 Please tell me.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.240
I am going to be your wife, big brother.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:46.270
I want to know everything about you!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.480
I will never be able to love her.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:56.400
You tell me that it is common in arranged marriages but...

00:16:57.390 --> 00:16:59.680
...Ling-Lee wishes to have her dreams come true in marriage.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:02.390
I feel sorry for her.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:08.850
Master Ling-Lee is a part of the clan. 
 She will understand one day.

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:13.790
I will bring you some nutrition pills later. 
 Please rest up until then.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:24.680
It's not going away.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:31.920
This fever will never go away.

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:38.700
If it will go away that quickly, it would have faded in the last twelve years.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:44.240
I promised never to see her again but...

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:46.980
...every time I think about her...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:56.410
...Kajika, you think I've betrayed you.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.950
You'll hate me without knowing what happened.

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.960
If it's something that I'll forget, I will rather have her hate me.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.420
It's better than you disappearing from this earth.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:18.140
Even if my mind says so, my body isn't following.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:23.960
I can't believe how pitiful of a man I am.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:33.550
Losing you is like being dead while I live in this body.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:37.220
This is punishment for having Kajika go through agony.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:43.710
<i>It's not as I planned. 
 I didn't know that Master Lee-Leng was into Master Kajika this much.</i>

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:48.620
<i>But, I will have him recover as the leader of the Huangs, whatever the cost may be!</i>

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.610
- Zao. 
- What is it?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.910
I received a call from Master Rosenthal a few moments ago.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.520
He wanted to meet with Master Lee-Leng tonight.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.940
Carl Rosenthal?

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:09.040
I told him he couldn't come, though he was very adamant about coming.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.510
<i>Is he going to check about the marriage?</i>

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:23.280
Lee-Leng probably conceded to Zao's plan in exchange for your safety.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.110
Zao? Did he---

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:30.600
He will do it. 
 Because he is one of the Huangs.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.930
He's that kind of person.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:37.070
- How awful! 
- It's also Lee-Leng's fault for conceding to that too.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.410
That's his weakness.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.170
He can't see past you.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:49.430
If someone else was at risk he would have taken a different course of action.

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:56.280
I won't get involved in this.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.990
I'm not going to get in a fight with the Huangs.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:03.250
This is my decision as the director of the Burnsworth Group.

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:13.220
- Dad.
- And, what are you going to do?

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.790
Are you just going to sit here and watch it unfold?

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.420
I---

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:30.330
Master, why did you say such a thing?

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:35.330
How unfortunate. 
 Why didn't you help her out?

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.260
This will be a turning point for Kajika.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.850
I didn't raise her to rely on me.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:49.980
But, Master, didn't you raise Master Lee-Leng as the husband of Master Kajika?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.330
Kajika is the one who chooses.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:21:02.790
That's why I chose other men that'll measure up to him.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.980
I was all in for Lee-Leng but...

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:11.450
...I didn't mind who Kajika chose.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.130
Master, you are so strict.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:19.860
A man who will fold under pressure like this won't be able to take care of Kajika.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.630
Kitty put her life on the line to save her.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.720
A halfhearted man will not get her.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:35.380
It's that dangerous to have the Burnsworth name.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:40.540
On top of that, Kajika has a secret beyond that.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.540
Someone that can protect her beside me...

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:52.070
-...a partner she can have for life is the man I was looking for.  
- Master.

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:56.370
Kitty was such a strong woman.

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:59.520
Kajika is her daughter.

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:04.940
She will find the path she is supposed to go on.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:15.030
Why did he decide without telling me anything?

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:21.210
Did I seem that helpless to Lee-Leng?

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:28.190
I hate this! 
 I will not agree with this!

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:33.130
I will not stay quiet!

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:41.540
Master Kajika! 
 There's an emergency!

00:22:42.940 --> 00:22:48.610
Major Noei called me and told me that His Highness Machaty is in critical condition!

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:52.880
<i>My grandfather is in critical condition?!</i>

00:22:54.980 --> 00:22:57.690
<i>My grandfather is in critical condition?!</i>

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
